# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# This repo is intended to be PUBLIC (GitHub Pages). NO PATIENT DATA may ever be
# committed. Strategy: ignore EVERYTHING at the root, then re-include only the
# folders that hold code (no records live in them). Patient files — the .xlsx
# register, scanned PDFs, NEEDS-CHECKING*.csv, desktop/patients.json, WhatsApp
# media — all sit at the root and stay ignored.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/docs/
!/webapp/

# Belt and suspenders: never track a data file even if one is placed inside an
# allowed folder by mistake.
*.xlsx
*.csv
*.pdf
*.ogg
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
*.sqlite
patients.json

# The desktop app's build artefacts, if that folder is ever un-ignored.
node_modules/
dist/
build/
